      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "To paraphrase: AI could kill us all by the end of the decade. But also I kept all my equity in OpenAI because I like money. I would consider going back. If we were literally on the cusp of creating killer AI then my answers would be different.\n\nI don't think anyone should be taking Coxon seriously",
